        "id": 2869711,
        "name": "Maximus Gate",
        "username": "Maximus_Gate",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/maximus_gate/{size}/497689_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-05-01T06:37:15.954Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey Capsuleers,</p>\n<p>I’ve been thinking about how much tech has evolved recently—especially with AI and voice recognition—and I wanted to throw out an idea that could really elevate immersion in EVE.</p>\n<p>What if we had <strong>voice command support</strong> built into the game?</p>\n<p>I’m not talking about gimmicky features, but practical, in-combat and navigation-focused commands that would let you <em>feel</em> more like a ship commander. Imagine being able to say things like:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>“Shields up”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>“Lock nearest target”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>“Fire when ready”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>“Warp to the next star system”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>“Align to station”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>“Launch drones”</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Instead of just clicking through menus, you’d be issuing orders—like an actual fleet commander or capsuleer interfacing with your ship’s AI.</p>\n<p>With how far AI voice tech has come in recent years, this feels more viable than ever. It could:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Improve accessibility</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Speed up reactions in combat</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add a whole new layer of immersion</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Open up interesting integrations with existing overview and command systems</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Obviously, there would need to be safeguards (confirmation prompts, customization, push-to-talk, etc.), but even as an optional feature, it could be a huge step forward.</p>\n<p>Curious what others think—would you use something like this, or do you see it as unnecessary complexity?</p>\n<p>Fly safe o7</p>\n<p>NOTE: This post is written by gpt since i couldn’t articulate my idea well enough. Sorry if that annoyed you <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/blush.png?v=15\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 10,
