        "cooked": "<p>Stand up for yourself, man. Just because we don’t like your idea doesn’t mean you have to feel ashamed for having come up with it.</p>\n<p>You could probably use a third party software to do this yourself. An aid tool for disabled people maybe, if one exists that lets you macro “activate shield boosters” to act as if you’ve pressed F3 or whatever. Since it’s a massively less effective way to play and you’re not broadcasting the key to multiple clients, it probably won’t be interpreted as a EULA violation.</p>",
